        "original_id": "dfeeaaf9-2338-5bc4-a80d-24fc11e288ac",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Companies: Creation Entertainment, Fangoria Magazine\n- Places: Glendale, California; Los Angeles, California\n- Events: Fangoria's Weekend of Horrors\n- Films: The Boy (2015 film)\n- People: Craig Macneill, Clay McLeod Chapman, Jared Breeze, David Morse, Rainn Wilson\n\nFacts:\n- In 2014, Glendale, California, had an estimated population of 200,167, making it the third-largest city in Los Angeles County and the 23rd-largest city in California.\n- Creation Entertainment is an American for-profit entertainment company based in Glendale, California.\n- Creation Entertainment produces fan conventions for fans of various films and television series, mainly in the science fiction, horror, and fantasy genres.\n- Fangoria's Weekend of Horrors was formerly produced in partnership with Creation Entertainment.\n- Fangoria's Weekend of Horrors is now owned exclusively by Fangoria Magazine and is held annually in Los Angeles, California.\n- The Boy is a 2015 American horror film directed by Craig Macneill and written by Craig Macneill and Clay McLeod Chapman.\n- The Boy stars Jared Breeze, David Morse, and Rainn Wilson.",
